\frac{25s^2}{16} &= 0.36s^2\\
\Rightarrow\qquad 25s^2 &= 5.76s^2\\
\Rightarrow\qquad \frac{\frac{25s^2}{16}}{5.76s^2} &= \frac{25}{5.76}\\
