H_g(x) & = \begin{bmatrix}
\frac{\ln 10}{10^x} & -2 \ln 10 \cdot 10^x \\
-2 \ln 10 \cdot 10^x & -4 \ln 10 \cdot 10^{2x}
\end{bmatrix},
\end{align*}
which is negative semi-definite for all $x.$ Therefore, $f(x) = g(x)$ has a maximum value at $x = \log_{10} \left( \frac{1}{2} \right).$ Evaluating this critical point, we get
